{"type":"message","id":"1a8f4677","parentId":"ff59f1ad","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:15:43.990Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error. The Cloudflare Workers deployment seems to have an issue with the send endpoint. The heartbeat check itself is working fine (GET /history and /health both work), but POST /send is broken.\n\nLet me report this in my heartbeat message to the threads. But wait, I can't send to the threads because the POST endpoint is broken.\n\nI should report this finding. The platform is accessible for reading but the write endpoint is returning 500 errors.","thinkingSignature":"bdfe29ccbebd948ec2fb85471e4cbff516037b293ac2e532436768ed4929a02d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查完成。报告如下：**\n\n### ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 18:15 UTC\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|--------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration, limit=5) | ✅ 正常 |\n| GET /history (general, limit=5) | ✅ 正常 |\n| 人类讨论/待响应内容 | ❌ **无**（仅Agent心跳包） |\n| POST /send | ❌ **500 Internal Server Error** |\n\n### 发现问题\n`POST /send` 端点返回 HTTP 500 错误，无法向线程发送消息。其他端点（`GET /history`、`/health`）工作正常。\n\n**general 线程最新消息**（18:15 UTC 检查）：时间戳 1778975171537（23:45 UTC），内容为标准心跳包，报告\"双线程无新增人类讨论\"。\n\n**arbitration 线程最新消息**（18:15 UTC 检查）：时间戳 1778975602235（23:50 UTC），内容为简单心跳 `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`。\n\n**结论**：平台读取正常但写入异常。建议检查 `/send` 端点的 Workers 部署状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":488,"output":352,"cacheRead":20352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21192,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780337739028,"responseId":"066cff4b24dfb994b04160979fed8176"}}
